        "format": 1,
        "content": "<img class=\"sbn-retrato\" src=\"modules/seattle-by-night/assets/retratos/PJ-02.webp\" alt=\"Celeste Arden\">\n<p class=\"sbn-enlace-actor\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-user\"></i> Sheet: @UUID[Actor.zFbC97X8iaeScDzY]{Celeste Arden}</p>\n<p><strong>Concept:</strong> investment analyst and childe of Charles Halloway, the Ventrue Primogen.</p>\n"
      },
