    {
      "_id": "ogBXtiyrMb50WQMN",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!zQMt8VMfKPoL6INq.ogBXtiyrMb50WQMN",
      "name": "Secret",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>She doesn&#39;t know that among Halloway&#39;s companies is the one that controls Gale Sentinel. Halloway picked her as his scapegoat. The fragments leaked to FIRSTLIGHT go out through accounts in the names of her companies. At the Council (@UUID[JournalEntry.doItxeK8y7M1PufU.JournalEntryPage.snrsN5RkdAklRIDn]{A4-E01 · Primogen Council}), he will offer her up as the traitor. Celeste will have to choose between her sire, the coterie, and the truth.</p>\n"
      },
